  <entity01515323:DescriptionOfFinancialAssetsFairValueOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAssetOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAsset1TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_MeasurementAxis_ifrs-full_AtFairValueMember" xml:lang="ko">공란은 장부금액이 공정가치의 합리적인 근사치이므로 공정가치 공시에서 제외하였습니다.</entity01515323:DescriptionOfFinancialAssetsFairValueOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAssetOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAsset1TableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:DescriptionOfFinancialAssetsFairValueOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAssetOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAsset1TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_MeasurementAxis_ifrs-full_AtFairValueMember" xml:lang="ko">공란은 장부금액이 공정가치의 합리적인 근사치이므로 공정가치 공시에서 제외하였습니다.</entity01515323:DescriptionOfFinancialAssetsFairValueOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAssetOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueByTypeOfFinancialAsset1TableOfItems>
