  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfOperatingProfitInOperatingSegmentsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사의 경영진은 부문 영업이익에 근거하여 영업부문의 성과를 평가하고 있습니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfOperatingProfitInOperatingSegmentsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfOperatingProfitInOperatingSegmentsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사의 경영진은 부문 영업이익에 근거하여 영업부문의 성과를 평가하고 있습니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfOperatingProfitInOperatingSegmentsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueFromExternalCustomersOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사의 외부고객으로부터의 수익은 대부분 재화의 판매로 이루어졌으며, 이자수익 및 배당수익은 금융수익에 포함되어 있습니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueFromExternalCustomersOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueFromExternalCustomersOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사의 외부고객으로부터의 수익은 대부분 재화의 판매로 이루어졌으며, 이자수익 및 배당수익은 금융수익에 포함되어 있습니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueFromExternalCustomersOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueGovernmentGrantOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2023년 1월 1일부터 시행되는 미국 인플레이션감축법(Inflation Reduction Act) 첨단제조 생산세액공제 제도 등에 따라 북미 내에서 생산하고 판매한 배터리 셀/모듈에 대하여 일정규모의 세액공제 금액을 수취할 수 있으며, 해당 금액은 연결회사가 당반기 수취할 것으로 예상되는 수익금액입니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueGovernmentGrantOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueGovernmentGrantOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity01515323_LgEnergySolutionLtdOfOperatingSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2023년 1월 1일부터 시행되는 미국 인플레이션감축법(Inflation Reduction Act) 첨단제조 생산세액공제 제도 등에 따라 북미 내에서 생산하고 판매한 배터리 셀/모듈에 대하여 일정규모의 세액공제 금액을 수취할 수 있으며, 해당 금액은 연결회사가 당반기 수취할 것으로 예상되는 수익금액입니다.</entity01515323:ExplanationOfRevenueGovernmentGrantOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfItems>
